WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.443
Today is the last word, and then a story.

2
00:00:02.893 --> 00:00:09.705
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.205 --> 00:00:12.784
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.284 --> 00:00:14.413
Say the word. Said.

5
00:00:17.802 --> 00:00:18.743
The word is said.

6
00:00:19.443 --> 00:00:21.896
The first letter and the last letter play fair.

7
00:00:22.346 --> 00:00:28.977
The middle part is two letters that make one sound. It is the sound in the middle of bed. That is the heart part.

8
00:00:29.427 --> 00:00:31.043
These are today's two pages.

9
00:00:31.493 --> 00:00:38.592
Your child traces the word and draws the heart. Then step away, and press play on the listening track for job two.

10
00:00:39.042 --> 00:00:45.349
When the page is done, turn to the story. Every word in it is one your child has mapped, or can sound out.

11
00:00:45.799 --> 00:00:49.889
If a word is stuck, do not say it. Say: tap it. Which part is the heart?

12
00:00:50.339 --> 00:00:54.223
Let your child read the story to you. Then to someone else in the family.
